    {
      "name": "🔌 WebSocket (STOMP)",
      "description": "WebSocket real-time chat via STOMP protocol.\n\n## How to test in Postman\n\n1. Open a new **WebSocket Request** tab in Postman\n2. Set URL: `ws://localhost:8888/ws/websocket`\n3. Under **Headers**, add:\n   - `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`\n4. Connect\n5. Use the STOMP frames below\n\n## STOMP Frame format\nPostman sends raw text frames. Use the STOMP protocol format shown in each request.\n\n## Subscriptions (subscribe before sending)\n- Chat messages: `/topic/chat/{{chatId}}`\n- Typing events: `/topic/chat/{{chatId}}/typing`\n- Private errors: `/user/queue/errors`",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "CONNECT (authenticate)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "description": "## STOMP CONNECT frame\n\nSend this as the first frame after opening the WebSocket connection.\n\n```\nCONNECT\naccept-version:1.1,1.2\nheart-beat:10000,10000\nAuthorization:Bearer {{token}}\n\n\\u0000\n```\n\n**Note:** In Postman WebSocket, paste the frame text in the message body.",
            "url": { "raw": "ws://{{baseUrl}}/ws/websocket", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["ws","websocket"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "SUBSCRIBE to chat",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "description": "## STOMP SUBSCRIBE frame\n\nSubscribe to receive messages from a chat room.\n\n```\nSUBSCRIBE\nid:sub-chat\ndestination:/topic/chat/{{chatId}}\n\n\\u0000\n```",
            "url": { "raw": "ws://{{baseUrl}}/ws/websocket", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["ws","websocket"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "SUBSCRIBE to typing events",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "description": "## STOMP SUBSCRIBE frame — typing indicator\n\n```\nSUBSCRIBE\nid:sub-typing\ndestination:/topic/chat/{{chatId}}/typing\n\n\\u0000\n```",
            "url": { "raw": "ws://{{baseUrl}}/ws/websocket", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["ws","websocket"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "SUBSCRIBE to errors (private)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "description": "## STOMP SUBSCRIBE frame — private errors\n\n```\nSUBSCRIBE\nid:sub-errors\ndestination:/user/queue/errors\n\n\\u0000\n```",
            "url": { "raw": "ws://{{baseUrl}}/ws/websocket", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["ws","websocket"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "SEND message",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "description": "## STOMP SEND frame — send a new message\n\nDestination: `/app/chat/{chatId}/send`\n\nBroadcast to: `/topic/chat/{chatId}`\n\n```\nSEND\ndestination:/app/chat/{{chatId}}/send\ncontent-type:application/json\n\n{\"content\":\"Hello everyone!\"}\n\\u0000\n```\n\n**WsInboundMessage body:**\n```json\n{\n  \"content\": \"Hello everyone!\"\n}\n```",
            "url": { "raw": "ws://{{baseUrl}}/ws/websocket", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["ws","websocket"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "SEND edit message",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
